 Q("Choose the correct sentence:", "Neither the manager nor the employees were present.", ["Neither the manager nor the employees was present.", "Neither the manager or the employees were present.", "Neither the manager nor the employees is present."], "With neither…nor, the verb agrees with the nearer subject (employees)."),
